  "prefLabel": "Jus 607.01 Non-Appropriation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 607.01 Non-Appropriation. If sufficient funds are not appropriated or otherwise made available to support payment or reimbursement for claims filed under the program in any fiscal year, the department shall not be liable to the claimant for such payment or reimbursement.\n\nSource. #12938, eff 12-9-19\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/jus600.html"
